# nqt-vault

Vault path: `nqt-vault/` (repo root). Manage with Obsidian CLI (`obsidian vault=nqt-vault …`).

When you finish a feature, fix, or architecture change:

1. Append a dated bullet to `nqt-vault/Project History/Change Log.md` with `[[wikilinks]]` to touched component notes.
2. Update or add the relevant note under Architecture / Components / Tabs (keep links bidirectional where useful).
3. For irreversible choices, add an ADR to `Decision Log.md` (never edit accepted ADRs — supersede).
4. Optional session note: `Project History/YYYY-MM-DD - Title.md`.

Do not put graphify HTML/JSON into the vault git tree; export only into the gitignored `Graphify/export/` folder.
